@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = 替换为你的用户 token

### dev login A
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/dev-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "openid": "dev_openid_a",
  "nickname": "测试用户A"
}

### dev login B
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/dev-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "openid": "dev_openid_b",
  "nickname": "测试用户B"
}

### wx login placeholder
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/wx-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "mock-wx-code",
  "nickname": "微信测试用户"
}

### me
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

